#!desc= Premium Unlocker: Locket Gold & AI Filter + YouTube Premium + SoundCloud Go+ + PDF tools + Photo Editors + Utilities. Chỉ dùng cá nhân — không bán lại hoặc chia sẻ công khai.
#!author=ThaiDev09
#!system=ios,mac
#!moduleUrl=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ThaiDev09/locketgold_tool/refs/heads/main/FOUR_IN_ONE_ThaiDev09.sgmodule
#!howtouse=Shadowrocket / Loon / Surge — Bật HTTPS Decryption (MITM). Quantumult X: bỏ [Rule] AND.


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  [Rule]  — Chặn quảng cáo video qua UDP (chỉ Shadowrocket hỗ trợ cú pháp AND)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
[Rule]
AND,((DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlevideo.com),(PROTOCOL,UDP)),REJECT
AND,((DOMAIN,youtubei.googleapis.com),(PROTOCOL,UDP)),REJECT


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  [Header Rewrite] — Xóa cache RevenueCat & Spotify (ép lấy data tươi)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
[Header Rewrite]
^https?://api.revenuecat.com/.+/(receipts$|subscribers/?(.*?)*$) header-del x-revenuecat-etag
^https?://api.revenuecat.com/.+/(receipts$|subscribers/?(.*?)*$) header-del X-RevenueCat-ETag
http-request ^https:\/\/(spclient\.wg\.spotify\.com|.*-spclient\.spotify\.com(:443)?)\/user-customization-service\/v1\/customize$ header-del if-none-match


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  [Url Rewrite] — Chặn quảng cáo YouTube / Google Video
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
[Url Rewrite]
# Chặn quảng cáo Google Video
^https?:\/\/[\w-]+\.googlevideo\.com\/(?!(dclk_video_ads|videoplayback\?)).+&oad _ reject-200
# YouTube Ads
^https?:\/\/(www|s)\.youtube\.com\/api\/stats\/ads _ reject-200
^https?:\/\/(www|s)\.youtube\.com\/(pagead|ptracking) _ reject-200
^https?:\/\/s\.youtube\.com\/api\/stats\/qoe\?adcontext _ reject-200
# Chặn ad request chung
(^https?:\/\/[\w-]+\.googlevideo\.com\/(?!dclk_video_ads).+?)&ctier=L(&.+?),ctier,(.+) $1$2$3 302


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  [Script] — Tổng hợp 15+ script theo nhóm app
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
[Script]

# ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ 🎭  LOCKET — GOLD + AI FILTER + REMOTE CONFIG                     │
# └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
# 1️⃣ Xóa header cache RevenueCat (buộc server trả body mới thay vì 304)
locket_delete_header = type=http-request, pattern=^https:\/\/api\.revenuecat\.com\/.+\/(receipts|subscribers), script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sb-doanthai/Locket2/refs/heads/main/deleteheader.js, timeout=60

# 2️⃣ RevenueCat Response — cấp subscription Gold (locket_1600_1y)
locket_gold = type=http-response, pattern=^https:\/\/api\.revenuecat\.com\/.+\/(receipts$|subscribers\/[^/]+$), script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sb-doanthai/Locket2/refs/heads/main/revenuecat.js, requires-body=true, max-size=-1, timeout=60

# 3️⃣ Remote Config — bật toàn bộ feature (widget, filter, caption, gold gates)
locket_rc = type=http-response, pattern=^https:\/\/firebaseremoteconfig\.googleapis\.com\/v1\/projects\/locket-4252a\/.+, script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sb-doanthai/Locket2/refs/heads/main/locket.js, requires-body=true, max-size=-1, timeout=60

# 4️⃣ AI Filter + Community VIP Network (request + response — 2 script cùng file)
locket_filter_req  = type=http-request,  pattern=^https:\/\/api\.locketcamera\.com\/.+, max-size=-1, script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sb-doanthai/Locket2/refs/heads/main/locketfilter.js?v=20261010_0230, timeout=60
locket_filter_resp = type=http-response, pattern=^https:\/\/api\.locketcamera\.com\/.+, requires-body=true, max-size=-1, script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sb-doanthai/Locket2/refs/heads/main/locketfilter.js?v=20261010_0230, timeout=60

# ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ 🌐  SUB-STORE (Proxy tool)                                        │
# └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
Sub-Store Core = type=http-request, pattern=^https?:\/\/sub\.store\/((download)|api\/(preview|sync|(utils\/node-info))), requires-body=true, timeout=120, script-path=https://github.com/sub-store-org/Sub-Store/releases/latest/download/sub-store-1.min.js
Sub-Store Simple = type=http-request, pattern=^https?:\/\/sub\.store, requires-body=true, script-path=https://github.com/sub-store-org/Sub-Store/releases/latest/download/sub-store-0.min.js
Sub-Store Sync = type=cron, cronexp=0 0 * * *, wake-system=1, timeout=120, script-path=https://github.com/sub-store-org/Sub-Store/releases/latest/download/cron-sync-artifacts.min.js


# ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ ⚠️  MOJO — ĐÃ COMMENT VÌ XUNG ĐỘT VỚI LOCKET GOLD                 │
# │    (cùng endpoint api.revenuecat.com → script chạy đè lẫn nhau)   │
# │    → Nếu muốn dùng MOJO: comment dòng `locket_gold` ở trên,       │
# │      rồi bỏ dấu # ở dòng dưới.                                    │
# └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
# MOJO = type=http-response, pattern=^https:\/\/api\.revenuecat\.com\/v1\/(receipts|subscribers)/*, requires-body=1, script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/andanh447/locketgold_tool/refs/heads/main/mojo.js


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  [MITM] — Bật HTTPS Decryption
#  ⚠️ QUAN TRỌNG: api.locketcamera.com BẮT BUỘC có để AI Filter hoạt động
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
[MITM]
hostname = %APPEND%, api.revenuecat.com, firebaseremoteconfig.googleapis.com, api.locketcamera.com, api.locketcam.com, *.googlevideo.com, youtubei.googleapis.com, www.youtube.com, s.youtube.com, -redirector*.googlevideo.com, sub.store, api-mobile.soundcloud.com, spclient.wg.spotify.com, *spclient.spotify.com, service.ilovepdf.com, lcs-mobile-cops.adobe.io, api.picsart.c*, api.meiease.c*, piccollage.com, pro.smallpdf.com, buy.itunes.apple.com, us-central1-alight-creative.cloudfunctions.net, premium*.truecaller.com
